[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3180.47, "timestamp": "00:53:00", "text": "その日。右。だから、私たちは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3182.309, "timestamp": "00:53:02", "text": "電話とかそういうこと。だから、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3184.87, "timestamp": "00:53:04", "text": "彼に伝えてください。ええ、そうすべきではないかもしれません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3188.03, "timestamp": "00:53:08", "text": "私の本名を言ってください"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3189.722, "timestamp": "00:53:09", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "joq don't go to Japan I am gonna miss you 😢😭"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3190.91, "timestamp": "00:53:10", "text": "何。そして"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3194.845, "timestamp": "00:53:14", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/7cIfY5niDOmSkNAP08CA6A4"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3194.87, "timestamp": "00:53:14", "text": "ええ、そうですね、基本的なことを彼に伝えます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3197.829, "timestamp": "00:53:17", "text": "あれこれのまとめ。私はそうかもしれない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3202.15, "timestamp": "00:53:22", "text": "彼にPNGファイルを頼まなければならない。えっと、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3204.549, "timestamp": "00:53:24", "text": "私がIRLクリエイターやクリエイターのために行っていること"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3207.03, "timestamp": "00:53:27", "text": "ストリーミング配信をしない人やクリエイターではない人、私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3209.87, "timestamp": "00:53:29", "text": "やることは、大きなものを作ることができるかのどちらかです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3214.15, "timestamp": "00:53:34", "text": "乗組員が自らを代表する。私はただ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3216.71, "timestamp": "00:53:36", "text": "それを表す何か、そう、これ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3218.95, "timestamp": "00:53:38", "text": "誰かがここにいた、みたいな感じ。どちらか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3221.51, "timestamp": "00:53:41", "text": "Pクルーやランダムなアニメ画像を使用できます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3225.99, "timestamp": "00:53:45", "text": "あるいは、えっと、彼らの現実世界の何かが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3227.309, "timestamp": "00:53:47", "text": "それらは発生する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3229.99, "timestamp": "00:53:49", "text": "インターネットでその内容を公開する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3233.51, "timestamp": "00:53:53", "text": "などなどですが、私はIRLコンテンツに限定しています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3236.03, "timestamp": "00:53:56", "text": "クリエイターだけが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3238.63, "timestamp": "00:53:58", "text": "またコンテンツクリエイターは"}]